# Canvas.Pdf

A minimal, extensible PDF generation engine built in C# (.NET 10), without external PDF libraries.

## Features

- Create PDF documents and multiple pages
- Draw text with standard fonts
- Add document-level page numbers (`AddPageNumbers`)
- Filter page-number rendering by range or include/exclude lists
- Skip first/last page for page numbers and headers/footers
- Optional filtered numbering sequence for displayed page numbers (`UseFilteredPageSequence`)
- Add document-level headers/footers (`AddHeadersAndFooters`)
- Filter header/footer application by page range or include/exclude lists
- Exclude TOC pages from page numbers and headers/footers
- Optional filtered numbering sequence for header/footer templates (`UseFilteredPageSequence`)
- Use flow layout with margins and cursor (`CreateFlow`) including flow bookmarks and image helpers
- Keep headings/paragraphs with following block in flow mode
- Draw simple tables (`DrawSimpleTable`) with flow-mode auto pagination, weighted columns, alternating fills, and wrapped cells/auto row height
- Configure per-column table text alignment (`ColumnAlignments`)
- Configure table vertical alignment (`ColumnVerticalAlignments`, `CellVerticalAlignment`)
- Configure per-column table value formatting (`ColumnValueFormatters`)
- Customize table border rendering (outer/inner lines, color, width)
- Dashed/custom table border stroke styles (`OuterBorderStrokeStyle`, `InnerBorderStrokeStyle`)
- Paragraph rendering with wrapping and alignment (`Left`, `Center`, `Right`, `Justify`)
- Draw vector primitives (`Line`, `Rectangle`, `RoundedRectangle`, `Circle`, `Polygon`, `BezierCurve`)
- Configure stroke style (`PdfStrokeStyle`) for dashed lines, line caps, and line joins
- Draw images (`PNG`, `JPEG`) including PNG transparency (alpha)
- Image opacity and fit modes in flow layout (`AddImage(..., opacity)`, `AddImageFit`)
- Preserve aspect ratio with image layout helpers (`DrawImageScaledToWidth`, `DrawImageScaledToHeight`, `DrawImageFit`, `DrawImageFitCenter`)
- Add clickable links (`AddWebLink`, `AddPageLink`)
- Add named destinations/anchor links (`AddNamedDestination`, `AddNamedDestinationLink`)
- Add document bookmarks/outlines (`AddBookmark`)
- Generate linked table of contents pages (`AddTableOfContents`)
- Insert TOC at end or beginning (`PdfTableOfContentsPlacement`)
- Optional content stream compression on save (`PdfSaveOptions`)
- Export to file, stream, or byte array (`Save`, `Save(Stream, ...)`, `ToBytes`)
- Optional generation diagnostics metrics (`PdfSaveOptions.CollectDiagnostics`, `PdfDocument.LastDiagnostics`)
- Add document-wide text watermarks (`AddTextWatermark`)
- Filter watermark rendering by page range/include/exclude/TOC/first-last skip
- Solid document page background helper (`SetPageBackground`)
- Color support:
  - RGB (`PdfColor`)
  - Grayscale (`PdfGrayColor`)
  - CMYK (`PdfCmykColor`)
- Document metadata (`Title`, `Author`, `Subject`, etc.)

## Quick Start

```csharp
using Canvas.Pdf;

var doc = new PdfDocument(defaultFont: PdfStandardFonts.FromStyle(PdfFontFamily.Times));
doc.Info.Title = "Hello Canvas.Pdf";

var page = doc.AddPage();
page.DrawText("Hello World", x: 100, y: 700, fontSize: 14);
page.DrawImage("logo.png", x: 100, y: 620, width: 120, height: 80);

doc.Save("output.pdf");
```

## Demo

Run the included console demo:

```powershell
dotnet run --project Canvas/Canvas.csproj
```

The output file is generated at:
`Canvas/bin/Debug/net10.0/output.pdf`

